CORE dfcc-only
main.c
--dfcc main --enforce-contract callee
^\[handler\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ argument bound to x: SUCCESS$
^\[handler\.assigns\.\d+\] line \d+ Check that g is assignable: SUCCESS$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
--
The write set argument has to bind to the write set parameter of the target of
a call through a function pointer, whatever the type of the pointer.
